  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/media.html#the-audio-element\r\n\r\n> The src, preload, autoplay, loop, muted, and controls attributes are the attributes common to all media elements\\.\r\n> \r\n> \r\n\r\nFrom https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/media.html#media-elements,\r\n\r\n> The media element attributes, src, crossorigin, preload, autoplay, loop, muted, and controls, apply to all media elements. They are defined in this section.\r\n\r\nAudio element documentation does not specify crossorigin apply to all media elements even though crossorigin is an attribute of audio element.\r\n\r\nThis may create confusion.",
